+    // Standard calls only: 3DA0X, 3DA0XYZ, 3XZ0AB and 3XZ0A went as standard calls through the 3DA0 -> 3D0 and
+    // 3X -> Q shortcuts, which WSJT-X does not take for standard (its chkcall.f90) and throws away; they go as
